--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

VidPure is an orchestrator: it implements no AI models of its own and does
not redistribute third-party model weights. The components below are either
invoked as external programs at runtime, or are optional runtime
dependencies. Each remains under its own upstream license.

  Real-ESRGAN (NCNN Vulkan build)   BSD-3-Clause
      https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN
  IOPaint / lama-cleaner            Apache-2.0
      https://github.com/Sanster/IOPaint
  LaMa                              Apache-2.0
      https://github.com/advimman/lama
  whisper.cpp                       MIT
      https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp
  ctc-forced-aligner                MIT
      https://github.com/MahmoudAshraf97/ctc-forced-aligner


