--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Model weights — including Real-ESRGAN .bin / .param / .pth files, whisper
ggml models, and CTC forced-aligner checkpoints — are NOT part of this
distribution. They are downloaded at runtime from each upstream project's
official release and are governed by the corresponding upstream licenses.
